{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"posts":2,"single":11,"page":12,"total":12,"previous":13,"next":14,"path":9,"tags":15,"months":61},"QNAP NAS DLNA / ffmpeg 変換",[3],{"title":1,"date":4,"day":5,"tags":6,"summary":8,"symbol":9,"html":10},"2017-05-05T15:58:16.000Z","2017-05-06",[7],"QNAP","QNAP / DLNA が最近動いていないのでメンテをしました","2017/05/06/QnapFfmpeg","\u003Cp>家で家族の動画を共有している QNAP / DLNA が最近動いていないのでメンテをしました。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>TwonkyServer がメンテされていないみたいなので、標準の DLNA Server に置き換えました。\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>PS4 から見に行くと反応が遅いですが、一応動いていますね。\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>もともと、MTS がうまく再生できていなかったのは、やっぱりうまくいかない。\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>トランスコード設定をしてみるが、やっぱりうまくいかない。\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>ログをみると変換に失敗しているようだ。\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>昔は、自分で QNAP 上で ffmpeg を実行して再生可能にしていたので、思い出しつつ実行してみる。  \u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>過去のスクリプトではやっぱりうまくいかない。\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>コマンドラインオプションが違うようだ。ffmpeg のバージョンが違うかな？\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>ググってみると複数の ffmpeg が入っているようだ。確かに。\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>新しい方でもやっぱりこける。ググってみるとライセンス上の問題で AC3 を外しているようだ。\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>しょうがないので自前ビルドしてみる。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>ipkg がない...。これも紆余曲折あって App Center から入らないようだ。\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"https://github.com/Entware-ng/Entware-ng/wiki/Install-on-QNAP-NAS\">こちらから\u003C/a>インストール\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>/opt/bin/opkg install ffmpeg\u003C/code>\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>なんとか動作。\u003C/p>\n",true,1,"2017/05/16/RayProfiler","2017/03/19/AssetBundleCompress4",[16,20,24,27,30,34,37,40,43,46,49,52,55,58],{"label":17,"count":18,"path":19},"Diary",3,"blog/tags/Diary",{"label":21,"count":22,"path":23},"Docker",4,"blog/tags/Docker",{"label":25,"count":12,"path":26},"Frigate","blog/tags/Frigate",{"label":28,"count":12,"path":29},"Hexo","blog/tags/Hexo",{"label":31,"count":32,"path":33},"Node.js",2,"blog/tags/Node.js",{"label":35,"count":18,"path":36},"Proxmox","blog/tags/Proxmox",{"label":7,"count":38,"path":39},6,"blog/tags/QNAP",{"label":41,"count":12,"path":42},"React","blog/tags/React",{"label":44,"count":12,"path":45},"Study","blog/tags/Study",{"label":47,"count":12,"path":48},"TypeScript","blog/tags/TypeScript",{"label":50,"count":38,"path":51},"Unity","blog/tags/Unity",{"label":53,"count":12,"path":54},"VRM","blog/tags/VRM",{"label":56,"count":22,"path":57},"Web","blog/tags/Web",{"label":59,"count":12,"path":60},"WebRtc","blog/tags/WebRtc",[62,65,68,71,74,77,80,83,86,89,92],{"label":63,"count":18,"path":64},"2026/09","archives/2026/09",{"label":66,"count":12,"path":67},"2020/02","archives/2020/02",{"label":69,"count":18,"path":70},"2019/12","archives/2019/12",{"label":72,"count":12,"path":73},"2019/11","archives/2019/11",{"label":75,"count":12,"path":76},"2019/10","archives/2019/10",{"label":78,"count":18,"path":79},"2019/09","archives/2019/09",{"label":81,"count":12,"path":82},"2019/02","archives/2019/02",{"label":84,"count":12,"path":85},"2018/03","archives/2018/03",{"label":87,"count":12,"path":88},"2017/10","archives/2017/10",{"label":90,"count":32,"path":91},"2017/05","archives/2017/05",{"label":93,"count":94,"path":95},"2017/03",5,"archives/2017/03"],"uses":{"params":["path"]}}]}
